          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A
            %strong neural network
            is a class of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/functions"} functions
            used in both
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supervised+learning"} supervised
            and
            %span.newWikiWord
              unsupervised
              %a{:href => "/nlab/new/unsupervised+learning"} ?
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/machine+learning"} machine learning
            to approximate a correspondence between samples in a dataset and their associated labels.
